# Purpose: focused L7 driver/coordinator evidence for cold2/warm3 preparation,
# coordinator-only RR scheduling, portable semantic refusal, and fail-closed publication.
# @req REQ-CSM-006 REQ-CSM-016 REQ-CSM-017 REQ-CSM-023 REQ-CSM-024 REQ-CSM-027

